# Only the readable Power Fx source (Src/*.pa.yaml) is tracked.
# Everything else in an .msapp is derived, large, or contains tenant details
# (data source URLs, author, connection info) and must stay out of the repo.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!Src/
!Src/*.pa.yaml
Src/_EditorState.pa.yaml
!paste-snippets/
!paste-snippets/*.yaml
!paste-snippets/*.txt
